      ],
      "properties": {
        "aux_id": "CGlide/WhatDreamsCost-CSGlide",
        "ver": "9f933b3c21128ca587f2144f4bb899e7fada12c8",
        "Node name for S&R": "LTXDirectorCS",
        "global_prompt": "The scene unfolds in a desolate, blood-soaked valley at the cusp of dawn. The mood is one of brutal desperation mixed with savage triumph; adrenaline pulses through every frame like an aggressive heartbeat. Static lighting transitions rapidly from deep indigo shadows to harsh orange and crimson highlights as the sun breaks over jagged rock formations. This environment feels raw, unforgiving, and intensely kinetic—a war zone caught in a moment of violent transition. The baseline is fast-paced intensity with dynamic handheld camera work that emphasizes chaos; quick cuts are implied by rapid scene changes between Varro's battle line and Harry’s confrontation against the colossal serpent creature (@ref2). Visual elements include thick, dark mist clinging to the ground near where @ref3 flies overhead, contrasted sharply against Marcus Varro in his silver armor. VISUALS + OPTIONAL MUSIC: The frame is dominated by splatters of deep red blood across polished metal and torn crimson fabric as a gigantic green serpent coils menacingly above an armored warrior (@ref2). A driving orchestral/heavy rock track pulses underneath the action, emphasizing relentless forward momentum.",
        "mainTrackEnabled": true,
        "audioTrackEnabled": true,
        "motionTrackEnabled": true,
        "audioTrackWasEnabledBeforeOverride": false,
        "inpaint_audio": true,
        "override_audio": false,
        "overrideAudio": false,
        "showFilenames": true,
        "showPromptZones": true,
        "use_custom_audio": true,
        "use_custom_motion": true,
        "frame_rate": 24,
        "display_mode": "seconds",
        "custom_width": 768,
        "custom_height": 512,
        "resize_method": "crop",
        "divisible_by": 32,
        "img_compression": 18,
        "guide_strength": "",
        "local_prompts": "Marcus Varro tracks through the carnage of his valley battle; @ref2 is visible in mid-ground near jagged rocks, bracing against an unseen blow while Fox (@ref3) circles above her head like a golden predator. His dark brown horse rears slightly over slick patches of bloodied earth, and the crimson cloak whips violently behind him as he drives forward into the enemy swarm; harsh orange light catches his silver segmented armor plating just before it is obscured by spray from an axe blow landing near @ref2’s feet—the sound design features a deafening roar mixed with heavy hoof beats. | Varro's upper torso fills the frame in an intense push-in; his gauntleted right hand grips tightly onto the hilt of his Gladius, while blood drips heavily from a deep gash across his chest armor plating—the light shifts to an aggressive crimson hue as he braces against another charging barbarian warrior who lunges at him with rusted iron claws. He shouts in Latin: \"Veni! Vidi! Vici!\" The sound is punctuated by the wet *thwack* of metal meeting flesh, followed immediately by a guttural war cry from one of his attackers; this beat emphasizes Varro's sheer physical exertion and unwavering aggression against overwhelming odds. | The camera orbits the colossal, toxic-green Basilisk as it coils high above @ref2 with its massive triangular head raised in a threatening posture; Fox (@ref3) swoops down from directly overhead to intercept—@ref2 recoils sharply backward as the serpent’s tail whips close enough that dark blood sputters onto her green and brown armor plating. She yells fiercely at the monster: \"Da оставь ты птицу!\" The light is now a dramatic, high-contrast indigo mixed with fiery red highlights reflecting off Basilisk's slick scales; Fox sings in lip-sync to an intense melody over the din of battle—a piercing wail cuts through chaos. | A whip pan transitions from Basilisk’s gaping, blood-dripping jaws to @ref2's determined face; she pivots her weight and swings a heavy axe in an arc meant to strike the serpent just behind its massive head—the lighting becomes intensely bright as sunlight begins piercing through the mist layer. As Fox (@ref3) dives low beneath Basilisk’s snout, delivering sharp strikes with his golden beak onto the creature's scaly nose ridges, @ref2 shouts desperately in Latin: \"На помощь!\" The sound is a combination of metallic *clang* (axe hitting scale), followed by an aggressive hiss from the serpent and Fox; this action defines active counter-attack against overwhelming power. | Marcus Varro completes his final strike, forcing the last remaining barbarian warrior to collapse beneath his heavy boots; smoke billows up around him in thick plumes against the brilliant orange glow of morning light—the environment shifts from bloody chaos to triumphant exhaustion. He stands utterly alone amidst scattered corpses and overturned shields (@ref3's presence is implied by a distant shadow crossing Varro’s field); he raises his head with deliberate power, chest rising dramatically as if taking an enormous breath after surviving the onslaught; The final sound heard is Marcus drawing in one deep gasp of air—a ragged *huff* that sounds like victory itself.",
        "segment_lengths": "152,114,190,114,151",
        "timeline_data": "{\"mainTrackEnabled\":true,\"audioTrackEnabled\":true,\"motionTrackEnabled\":true,\"propHeight\":90,\"globalPropHeight\":60,\"showFilenames\":true,\"showPromptZones\":true,\"overrideAudio\":false,\"inpaint_audio\":true,\"global_prompt\":\"The scene unfolds in a desolate, blood-soaked valley at the cusp of dawn. The mood is one of brutal desperation mixed with savage triumph; adrenaline pulses through every frame like an aggressive heartbeat. Static lighting transitions rapidly from deep indigo shadows to harsh orange and crimson highlights as the sun breaks over jagged rock formations. This environment feels raw, unforgiving, and intensely kinetic—a war zone caught in a moment of violent transition. The baseline is fast-paced intensity with dynamic handheld camera work that emphasizes chaos; quick cuts are implied by rapid scene changes between Varro's battle line and Harry’s confrontation against the colossal serpent creature (@ref2). Visual elements include thick, dark mist clinging to the ground near where @ref3 flies overhead, contrasted sharply against Marcus Varro in his silver armor. VISUALS + OPTIONAL MUSIC: The frame is dominated by splatters of deep red blood across polished metal and torn crimson fabric as a gigantic green serpent coils menacingly above an armored warrior (@ref2). A driving orchestral/heavy rock track pulses underneath the action, emphasizing relentless forward momentum.\",\"retake_global_prompt\":\"\",\"retakeMode\":false,\"retakeStart\":24,\"retakeLength\":48,\"retakePrompt\":\"\",\"retakeStrength\":1,\"retakeVideo\":null,\"normalStartFrame\":0,\"normalDurationFrames\":721,\"reference_mode\":\"Ghost Mask (End)\",\"disable_prompt_relay\":false,\"msr_prefix_frames\":41,\"analyzeProvider\":\"custom\",\"analyzeBaseUrl\":\"http://127.0.0.1:8080\",\"analyzeModel\":\"Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct-abliterated.Q8_0.gguf\",\"characters\":[{\"images\":[{\"name\":\"Workflow_fn7_tl1/ltxref_reiter.png\"}],\"description\":\"Roman cavalry soldier in silver segmented armor with red plume helmet, riding dark brown horse, wearing crimson cloak, holding sword, detailed saddle and bridle.\"},{\"images\":[{\"name\":\"Workflow_fn7_tl1/ltxref_Gemini_Generated_Image_5zbr2x5zbr2x5zbr.png\"}],\"description\":\"Female warrior in weathered green and brown armor with fur trim, wielding axes and spear, wearing leaf-adorned helmet, bloodstains visible on clothing and gear.\"},{\"images\":[{\"name\":\"Workflow_fn7_tl1/ltxref_Gemini_Generated_Image_hbq1xxhbq1xxhbq1.png\"},{\"name\":\"Workflow_fn7_tl1/ltxref_centurion.jpg\"}],\"description\":\"Roman legionary soldier in weathered silver armor with red fabric elements, holding sword and ornate shield featuring golden eagle emblem, wearing brown leather boots and greaves.\\nRoman legionary soldier in detailed bronze and dark red armor, wearing a red plume helmet, holding a short sword, with a crimson cloak draped over shoulders and greaves covering legs.\"}],\"segments\":[{\"id\":\"1786355212675seg0\",\"start\":0,\"length\":152,\"prompt\":\"Marcus Varro tracks through the carnage of his valley battle; @ref2 is visible in mid-ground near jagged rocks, bracing against an unseen blow while Fox (@ref3) circles above her head like a golden predator. His dark brown horse rears slightly over slick patches of bloodied earth, and the crimson cloak whips violently behind him as he drives forward into the enemy swarm; harsh orange light catches his silver segmented armor plating just before it is obscured by spray from an axe blow landing near @ref2’s feet—the sound design features a deafening roar mixed with heavy hoof beats.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"isAnchor\":false,\"isEndFrame\":false},{\"id\":\"1786355212675seg1\",\"start\":152,\"length\":114,\"prompt\":\"Varro's upper torso fills the frame in an intense push-in; his gauntleted right hand grips tightly onto the hilt of his Gladius, while blood drips heavily from a deep gash across his chest armor plating—the light shifts to an aggressive crimson hue as he braces against another charging barbarian warrior who lunges at him with rusted iron claws. He shouts in Latin: \\\"Veni! Vidi! Vici!\\\" The sound is punctuated by the wet *thwack* of metal meeting flesh, followed immediately by a guttural war cry from one of his attackers; this beat emphasizes Varro's sheer physical exertion and unwavering aggression against overwhelming odds.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"isAnchor\":false,\"isEndFrame\":false},{\"id\":\"1786355212675seg2\",\"start\":266,\"length\":190,\"prompt\":\"The camera orbits the colossal, toxic-green Basilisk as it coils high above @ref2 with its massive triangular head raised in a threatening posture; Fox (@ref3) swoops down from directly overhead to intercept—@ref2 recoils sharply backward as the serpent’s tail whips close enough that dark blood sputters onto her green and brown armor plating. She yells fiercely at the monster: \\\"Da оставь ты птицу!\\\" The light is now a dramatic, high-contrast indigo mixed with fiery red highlights reflecting off Basilisk's slick scales; Fox sings in lip-sync to an intense melody over the din of battle—a piercing wail cuts through chaos.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"isAnchor\":false,\"isEndFrame\":false},{\"id\":\"1786355212675seg3\",\"start\":456,\"length\":114,\"prompt\":\"A whip pan transitions from Basilisk’s gaping, blood-dripping jaws to @ref2's determined face; she pivots her weight and swings a heavy axe in an arc meant to strike the serpent just behind its massive head—the lighting becomes intensely bright as sunlight begins piercing through the mist layer. As Fox (@ref3) dives low beneath Basilisk’s snout, delivering sharp strikes with his golden beak onto the creature's scaly nose ridges, @ref2 shouts desperately in Latin: \\\"На помощь!\\\" The sound is a combination of metallic *clang* (axe hitting scale), followed by an aggressive hiss from the serpent and Fox; this action defines active counter-attack against overwhelming power.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"isAnchor\":false,\"isEndFrame\":false},{\"id\":\"1786355212675seg4\",\"start\":570,\"length\":151,\"prompt\":\"Marcus Varro completes his final strike, forcing the last remaining barbarian warrior to collapse beneath his heavy boots; smoke billows up around him in thick plumes against the brilliant orange glow of morning light—the environment shifts from bloody chaos to triumphant exhaustion. He stands utterly alone amidst scattered corpses and overturned shields (@ref3's presence is implied by a distant shadow crossing Varro’s field); he raises his head with deliberate power, chest rising dramatically as if taking an enormous breath after surviving the onslaught; The final sound heard is Marcus drawing in one deep gasp of air—a ragged *huff* that sounds like victory itself.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"isAnchor\":false,\"isEndFrame\":false}],\"motionSegments\":[],\"audioSegments\":[]}",
        "epsilon": 0.001,
